{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"InnoRouter’s test stores follow TCA’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TestStore"},{"type":"text","text":" exhaustivity model:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events collected from the underlying authority (e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onChange"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onPresented"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onPathChanged"},{"type":"text","text":") accumulate in an internal queue. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" call dequeues the next event and asserts a predicate. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".strict"},{"type":"text","text":" mode any leftover events — or any events that arrive after an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"expectNoMoreEvents"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish"},{"type":"text","text":" call — are reported as Swift Testing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issues at the store’s deinitialization."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Controls how strictly a test store insists that every observed event be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asserted before the store is deallocated.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.deeplink\/SQ","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.deeplink\/SH","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.in